{"questions":[{"question_id":"1l2lf1rxa","paperTitle":"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 2 Offline","year":2011,"examDate":2011,"subject":"physics","chapter":"work-power-and-energy","chapterGroup":"mechanics","topic":"energy","type":"mcqm","marks":4,"negMarks":2,"permalink":"pa-thin-ring-of-mass-2-kg-and-radius-05-m-is-rolling-with-jee-advanced-physics-units-and-measurements-kqitwthyuqii4zju","content":"<p>A thin ring of mass 2 kg and radius 0.5 m is rolling without on a horizontal plane with velocity 1 m/s. A small ball of mass 0.1 kg, moving with velocity 20 m/s in the opposite direction hits the ring at a height of 0.75 m and goes vertically up with velocity 10 m/s. Immediately after the collision,</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l2mm234u/ed37b03f-fa71-4885-9dc0-f974dcc13836/8de237e0-c8ed-11ec-8c2d-13f33da2fbe1/file-1l2mm234v.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l2mm234u/ed37b03f-fa71-4885-9dc0-f974dcc13836/8de237e0-c8ed-11ec-8c2d-13f33da2fbe1/file-1l2mm234v.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Work Power &amp; Energy Question 9 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l2mm234u/ed37b03f-fa71-4885-9dc0-f974dcc13836/8de237e0-c8ed-11ec-8c2d-13f33da2fbe1/file-1l2mm234v.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l2mm234u/ed37b03f-fa71-4885-9dc0-f974dcc13836/8de237e0-c8ed-11ec-8c2d-13f33da2fbe1/file-1l2mm234v.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l2mm234u/ed37b03f-fa71-4885-9dc0-f974dcc13836/8de237e0-c8ed-11ec-8c2d-13f33da2fbe1/file-1l2mm234v.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l2mm234u/ed37b03f-fa71-4885-9dc0-f974dcc13836/8de237e0-c8ed-11ec-8c2d-13f33da2fbe1/file-1l2mm234v.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l2mm234u/ed37b03f-fa71-4885-9dc0-f974dcc13836/8de237e0-c8ed-11ec-8c2d-13f33da2fbe1/file-1l2mm234v.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l2mm234u/ed37b03f-fa71-4885-9dc0-f974dcc13836/8de237e0-c8ed-11ec-8c2d-13f33da2fbe1/file-1l2mm234v.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"the ring has pure rotation about its stationary CM."},{"identifier":"B","content":"the ring comes to a complete stop."},{"identifier":"C","content":"friction between the ring and the ground is to the left."},{"identifier":"D","content":"there is no friction between the ring and the ground."}],"correct_options":["A","C"],"explanation":"<p>Let M be the mass of the ring and m that of the ball and \n let V and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.222ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -443 540 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D710\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D710\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> be their velocity before collision. The initial momentum of the system (ring and ball) in the horizontal direction is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18.03ex\" height=\"3.629ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1410 7969.5 1604\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(248.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,558)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1033,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1604.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2660.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mover\" transform=\"translate(3711.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(208.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(121.5,799)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5055.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6055.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mover\" transform=\"translate(6933.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(230,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D710\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D710\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(36,559)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.622ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 9557.1 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1055.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2778.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3500.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4500.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6000.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7001.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7390.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(8168.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9168.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.565ex\" height=\"1.692ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 5111.8 748\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1055.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2778.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3556,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4611.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>From conservation of momentum, the final momentum of the system <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.667ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.478ex\" height=\"3.312ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1169 3305.5 1464\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(248.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,558)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1033,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1749.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2805.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in the horizontal direction. Hence <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.752ex\" height=\"1.902ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 3426.6 840.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(433,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1870.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2926.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> for the ring, i.e. the ring has pure rotation about its centre of mass. So choice (a) is correct.</p>\n<p>The total initial angular momentum of the system about the point of collision is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.839ex\" height=\"1.902ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 6559 840.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(714,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1285.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2341.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3219.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D710\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D710\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3759.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4432.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5433,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5937,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D714\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D714\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.814ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16.691ex\" height=\"2.798ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 7377.5 1236.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1055.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1933.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D710\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D710\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2473.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3147,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4147.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(5198.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-